    m_Untranslated: "<b>Main Camera:</b> position (\u22120.3, 1.3, \u221226.5), rotation (\u22123.7, 0.6, 0): eye height, looking very slightly up. <b>Field of View 40</b> (vertical). Clipping Planes: Near 0.05, Far 300."
