    m_UnmaskedViews: []
    MaskPreset: {fileID: 0}
  Text:
    m_Untranslated: '<b>Rendering.</b> In the camera''s <i>Rendering</i> section: <b>Post Processing</b> on, <b>Anti-aliasing: Temporal Anti-aliasing (TAA)</b>, <b>Dithering</b> on (it hides banding in the dark gradients of the fog).'
